AB  - Software testing provides a platform to ensure the software quality by tracing and debugging the different types of errors i.e. semantic or syntax errors. Continuous Integration and Continuous Development (CI/CD) supports dynamic and reliable platform for Software development and traditional testing techniques are not compatible with such advance development environment. Researchers addressed this issue and found various constraints related to the test case selection, reduction, execution, prioritization etc. and developed various automated testing methods using machine learning approach. This paper will investigate the various issues, challenges and recent advancement in automated software testing. It will also compare the outcomes of existing solutions under the constrains of performance metric like Accuracy, Precision, F1-Score, Recall and Average percentage of faults detected etc.
